#: postprocessing.md:2
msgid "Analysis"
msgstr "解析"

#: postprocessing.md:4
msgid "Copy relevant scripts in the analysis folder"
msgstr "必要なスクリプトを解析フォルダに Copy する"

#: postprocessing.md:15
msgid "Run ```script.sh``` which:"
msgstr "```script.sh``` を実行します。次の処理を行います。"

#: postprocessing.md:16
msgid "Convert dcds to xtc (dcd2xtc.py)"
msgstr "dcd を xtc に変換する (dcd2xtc.py)。"

#: postprocessing.md:17
msgid ""
"Concatenate xtcs to a single xtc ```gmx trjcat -f nosolv_*.xtc -cat -o "
"cat_trjcat.xtc -settime```"
msgstr ""
"xtc を1つに連結する：```gmx trjcat -f nosolv_*.xtc -cat -o cat_trjcat.xtc "
"-settime```"

#: postprocessing.md:18
msgid ""
"Calculate the Torrie-Valeau weights (Fullbias.dat) and the CVs (COLVAR) ``` "
"plumed driver --plumed plumed_analysis.dat --mf_xtc cat_trjcat.xtc ``` which"
" are afterwards used to calculate Free Energy Surfaces."
msgstr ""
"Torrie-Valeau Weight (Fullbias.dat) と CV (COLVAR) を計算し、後で自由エネルギー表面に使う：``` "
"plumed driver --plumed plumed_analysis.dat --mf_xtc cat_trjcat.xtc ```"

#: postprocessing.md:19
msgid ""
"Generate a structural ensemble by sampling the concatenated trajectory by "
"weights. ``` python resample.py ```"
msgstr ""
"連結 Trajectory を重みに従って Sampling し、Structural Ensemble を生成する：``` python "
"resample.py ```"

#: postprocessing.md:20
msgid ""
"Backmap coarse grained structural ensemble by using PULCHRA ``` python "
"backmap.py $nrep sh pulchra.sh sh keepH.sh ```"
msgstr ""
"PULCHRA で Coarse-grained Structural Ensemble を Backmapping する：``` python "
"backmap.py $nrep sh pulchra.sh sh keepH.sh ```"

#: postprocessing.md:32
msgid ""
"Plot the free energy surface per CV of interest. Note that the order of CVs "
"in: ``` for i in $(echo CV1 CV2 CV3 etc);do .. ``` needs to follow the order"
" these CVs appear as columns in the ```COLVAR``` file."
msgstr ""
"各対象 CV の自由エネルギー表面を描画します。``` for i in $(echo CV1 CV2 CV3 etc);do .. ``` の CV "
"順序は、```COLVAR``` の列の順序に合わせてください。"

#: postprocessing.md:54
msgid "Calculation of the Root Mean Square Fluctuations (RMSF) per residue."
msgstr "各残基の Root Mean Square Fluctuations (RMSF) の計算。"

#: postprocessing.md:77
msgid "![png](images/AF-IDP_colab_29_1.png)"
msgstr "![png](images/AF-IDP_colab_29_1.png)"

#: postprocessing.md:79
msgid ""
"Finally,to showcase the advantage of AF-MI, we show pair-distance "
"distribution function (PDDF) from SAXS data, based on a single AF PDB "
"structure and AF-MI structural ensemble "
"[Ref](https://www.biorxiv.org/content/10.1101/2023.01.19.524720v1.full)."
msgstr ""
"最後に AF-MI の利点を示すため、SAXS データ、単一 AF PDB 構造、AF-MI Structural Ensemble に基づく "
"Pair-distance Distribution Function (PDDF) を示します "
"[文献](https://www.biorxiv.org/content/10.1101/2023.01.19.524720v1.full)。"

